      <div class="slot"><div class="time">09:30<small>30 min</small></div><div><div class="ttl">Opening keynote: The agentic web</div><div class="who"><b>Mara Okafor</b> · CTO, Vellum</div></div><span class="room">Main Stage</span></div>
